          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omuzimu bwe gwamala okubingibwa, kasiru yaayogera abantu kamaala beewuunhia inho, baakoba bati: “Ekintu kiti tikibonekangaku mu Isiraeli!”",
          "type": "text",
